{"version":1,"content":"<p>解放軍南部戰區海軍周二通過微信公眾號「南海艦隊」發布消息稱，美國海軍「查爾斯頓」號瀕海戰鬥艦今天凌晨未經中國政府允許，進入南沙群島仙賓礁附近海域。</p><p>南部戰區海軍發言人尹剛說，解放軍已組織兵力依法依規對美艦進行跟蹤監視。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.222201+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:10:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:36.658763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684299+00:00","content_hash":"c7441c8392d5ce7b3dbb583a7398274b0b8330c99210bf3af17eb7339e7df398","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}